categories              emulators
license                 GPL-2+
maintainers             {@trodemaster icloud.com:manuals-unread2u} openmaintainer

description             QEMU for the OpenBIOS Power Mac G5 (PowerMac7,3)
long_description        {*}${description}. This is cat7's QEMU fork \
                        (branch G5-openbios), which emulates a Power Mac G5 \
                        with a 970FX CPU, an OpenBIOS firmware of its own and \
                        no need for an Apple ROM, and runs Mac OS X 10.4 and \
                        10.5 PowerPC guests. Only the ppc64 system target is \
                        built. It installs alongside the stock qemu port \
                        under ${prefix}/libexec/${name}, exposing the emulator as qemu-system-ppc64-cat7.

homepage                https://github.com/cat7/qemu/tree/G5-openbios

